{# Exposes the handful of UI strings rendered from JavaScript (Stimulus
   controllers, Turbo Stream actions) as a global keyed by their message id.
   Read via the `t()` helper in assets/utilities/i18n.js. Runs synchronously
   before the importmap modules, so window.appI18n is set before any controller
   connects. Add a line here whenever JS needs a new translated string. #}
